            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Meeting Coach 0.15.0</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Fixed: switching audio devices mid-meeting (taking a phone call on your Mac, connecting AirPods, plugging in a headset) silently killed the microphone — the app kept saying "Listening" but stopped transcribing. It now detects the change and reconnects to your mic automatically</li>
</ul>
